# Full fine-tune fallback of w1-moe.args (raw Megatron path with miles' Qwen3.5 spec, thd packing, HF->torch_dist conversion).
# Same as the fully async 35B CI case minus R3/CI flags. Use with MT=qwen3.5-35B-A3B CONFIG_NAME=w1-moe-full.
# miles W1 on Qwen3.5-35B-A3B (hybrid GDN + MoE, 256 experts), LoRA. Flags for train_async.py after the Megatron model args
# (launch/miles/w1-moe.sbatch: model_args qwen3.5-35B-A3B_lora, scripts/models/qwen3.5-35B-A3B_lora.py).
# Base: miles' own 35B-A3B LoRA launcher scripts/run_qwen3_5_35b_a3b_lora.py (Megatron-Bridge PEFT, --megatron-to-hf-mode bridge,
# bshd + micro-batch 1 because megatron-core's GatedDeltaNet rejects packed thd) and the fully async 35B-A3B CI case
# tests/e2e/megatron/test_qwen3_5_35B_A3B/test_nospec_r3_bf16_sgl_dpattn1x4_meg_tp1cp1_fullyasync.py (4 train GPUs TP1 x EP4 + 4 rollout GPUs).
# Everything else is w1-S.args (SHARED_W1). TRL match: LoRA r=32 alpha 64 lr 1e-5 on attention + GDN + shared-expert projections,
# routed experts and router frozen. $RUN and $STEPS are filled in by the launcher.
# --- checkpoints (bridge loads the HF checkpoint directly; no torch_dist conversion, no reference model since KL is 0)
--hf-checkpoint /fsx/amine_dirhoussi/stable-bench-runs/miles/models/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B/
--ref-load /fsx/amine_dirhoussi/stable-bench-runs/miles/ckpt/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B_torch_dist
--save $RUN/megatron
--save-interval 1000
# --- data, prompt, reward
--prompt-data /fsx/amine_dirhoussi/stable-bench-runs/miles/data/w1_train.parquet
--input-key messages
--label-key label
--apply-chat-template
--apply-chat-template-kwargs {"enable_thinking":false}
--rollout-max-prompt-len 2048
--custom-rm-path w1_reward.reward
# --- rollout (fully async, recipe settings)
--fully-async
--pause-generation-mode in_place
--num-rollout $STEPS
--rollout-batch-size 32
--n-samples-per-prompt 8
--global-batch-size 256
--rollout-max-response-len 16384
--rollout-temperature 1.0
--rollout-top-p 1.0
--rollout-top-k -1
--rollout-seed 42
--balance-data
# --- GRPO loss
--advantage-estimator grpo
--disable-grpo-std-normalization
--calculate-per-token-loss
--eps-clip 0.2
--eps-clip-high 0.28
--kl-loss-coef 0.0
--kl-coef 0.0
--entropy-coef 0.0
--use-tis
# --- optimizer (full FT: W1 lr; CPU Adam as miles' 35B-A3B recipe and CI, docs/models/qwen/qwen3-5-moe.md 5.4)
--optimizer adam
--lr 1e-6
--lr-decay-style constant
--lr-warmup-iters 0
--weight-decay 0.0
--adam-beta1 0.9
--adam-beta2 0.999
--clip-grad 1.0
--seed 42
--optimizer-cpu-offload
--overlap-cpu-optimizer-d2h-h2d
--use-precision-aware-optimizer
# --- Megatron parallelism: TP1 x EP4 (DP4) on 4 GPUs, as the fully async 35B CI case; bshd + mbs 1 as the LoRA launcher
--tensor-model-parallel-size 1
--pipeline-model-parallel-size 1
--context-parallel-size 1
--expert-model-parallel-size 4
--expert-tensor-parallel-size 1
--moe-token-dispatcher-type alltoall
--recompute-granularity full
--recompute-method uniform
--recompute-num-layers 1
--use-dynamic-batch-size
--max-tokens-per-gpu 18432
--attention-dropout 0.0
--hidden-dropout 0.0
--accumulate-allreduce-grads-in-fp32
--attention-softmax-in-fp32
--attention-backend unfused
# --- SGLang: 4 engines x TP1 (the whole 35B fits one B200), mem fraction as W1
--rollout-num-gpus-per-engine 1
--sglang-mem-fraction-static 0.7
--check-weight-update-skip-list visual
# --- placement: 4 train + 4 rollout GPUs on one node
--actor-num-nodes 1
--actor-num-gpus-per-node 4
--num-gpus-per-node 8
--rollout-num-gpus 4
